# Example clients file for scripts/kopia-enroll.sh. Copy it to
# kopia-clients.tsv (or anywhere, and set KOPIA_CLIENTS_FILE) and list your
# own containers. The rows below are invented.
#
# Columns (tab-separated):
#   ctid      the LXC's CTID
#   hostname  the LXC's hostname; the Kopia identity is <hostname>@<hostname>
#   paths     comma-separated absolute paths to snapshot
#   exclude   comma-separated absolute paths (or globs) under those paths to
#             skip, or "-" for none
#
# Exclude a live database directory and dump it into a backed-up path before
# each snapshot instead: a file copy of a running database is not a backup.

# ctid	hostname	paths	exclude
130	wiki	/app	/app/data/postgres
131	git-mirror	/app,/srv/repos	-
132	monitoring	/app	/app/prometheus,/app/loki/chunks
